  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Jae-I, who seemed more alpha than anyone else, manifested as an omega. His desire-filled eyes, longing to possess his own omega, fixated on his friend Ian. Having stayed by his side through college, Jae-I one day discovers Ian, who manifested as an omega late in life, being branded by an unwanted partner... From their school days to adulthood and cohabitation, is their meeting—where they become each other's soulmates—atonement, pity, or love?\n\nThe story of two male Omegas who can dream happy dreams only when they are together.\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
